		{"id":"n-comment","type":"text","text":"THE MAIN MACHINE — every session runs this. start/end are mechanical; boot is a sub-machine; idle is home. Seeding is a FUNCTION (se_seed_expedition, se_seed_iteration) — no start doors. Above idle: the ad hoc pair (expeditions · archive). Below: the planned pair. Beside: the retro, the FRONT DESK (in doubt, go here), and ideation (the slider's top notch).","x":-380,"y":-1200,"width":700,"height":140},
